* EMARC1 -- EDMARC audit log entry screen
MAP EMARC1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER     AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD USERID     AT 2,20  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD CLIENTID   AT 4,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ACTIONCODE AT 5,20  LEN 4  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD RESULTCODE AT 5,30  LEN 4  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD NOTES      AT 6,20  LEN 60 UNPROT DIM    COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD MESSAGE    AT 9,5   LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER     AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
